msgstr "已设置"

msgid "first reason"
msgstr "首次原因"

msgid "Not set"
msgstr "未设置"

msgid "Flow directions (IPv4 / IPv6)"
msgstr "流方向数（IPv4 / IPv6）"

msgid "Weighted flow slots (active / capacity)"
msgstr "加权流槽位（活动 / 容量）"

msgid "Quarantined rules (rules / slot budget)"
msgstr "隔离规则（规则数 / 槽位预算）"

msgid "Not reported by this kernel"
msgstr "此内核未提供"

msgid "Counts are current hardware state, not throughput; zero flows can be normal and a loaded module does not show that traffic is accelerated. An IPv6 rule takes two slots, and active slots plus the quarantine budget do not give exact free slots."
msgstr "计数为当前硬件状态，不代表吞吐量；流数为零可能正常，模块已加载也不代表流量已被加速。每条 IPv6 规则占两个槽位，活动槽位加隔离预算不能得出准确的空闲槽位。"

msgid "Failed"
msgstr "未通过"

msgid "Passed"
msgstr "通过"

msgid "NAND uncorrectable ECC counter must be readable and zero"
msgstr "NAND 不可纠正 ECC 计数必须可读且为零"

msgid "Requires the identity-preserved NAND layout"
msgstr "需要保留身份分区的 NAND 布局"

msgid "RC01 has no module-detect line: presence is inferred from module I2C reads, so \"not detected\" cannot prove the cage is empty. Presence LED mode: uci set system.led_sfp.rc01_presence=1."
msgstr "RC01 没有模块检测线，是否插入由模块 I2C 读取推断，因此“未检测到”不能证明笼子为空。在位指示灯模式：uci set system.led_sfp.rc01_presence=1。"

msgid "The guard record is current only for the one running guard within 10 s. A set latch is a software decision; it does not prove the fan reached full speed."
msgstr "仅当唯一运行中的守护进程在 10 秒内更新时，守护记录才视为当前记录。满速锁定是软件决定，不能证明风扇已达到满速。"

msgid "Trends are sampled only while this page is open"
msgstr "趋势仅在本页打开时采样"

msgid "checks OK"
msgstr "项检查正常"

msgid "every"
msgstr "间隔"

msgid "Identity partitions require readable ECC and no bad blocks"
msgstr "身份分区需要 ECC 可读且无坏块"

msgid "Rootfs bad blocks must fit the reserved capacity"
msgstr "rootfs 坏块数不得超过预留容量"

msgid "Shows ICMP echo reachability from the chosen egress on the front network LEDs (white and amber). It does not test DNS, web or proxies, and networks that filter ICMP show as unreachable. Other LEDs are not touched."
msgstr "在前面板网络指示灯（白色/琥珀色）上显示从所选出口到目标地址的 ICMP 回显可达性。不检测 DNS、网页或代理，过滤 ICMP 的网络会显示为不可达。不影响其他指示灯。"

msgid "Off by default. Drives white:network and amber:network unless a System → LED Configuration entry names them; stopping turns both off."
msgstr "默认关闭。启用后驱动 white:network 和 amber:network，除非“系统 → LED 配置”中已有条目使用它们；停止后两者熄灭。"
